# Per-developer environment. `make setup` copies this file to `.env.local`
# (which is git-ignored) the first time you run it; edit `.env.local`, not this
# file. The Makefile sources `.env.local` before every `tuist` invocation, so
# these values reach the ProjectDescription manifest via `Environment.<key>`.
#
# Any variable prefixed `TUIST_` shows up as `Environment.<camelCase>` in
# `Project.swift`. Non-`TUIST_` variables can be sourced too but won't be
# visible to Tuist manifests.

# Apple Developer Team ID used for automatic code signing. Find it at
# https://developer.apple.com/account under Membership > Team ID. Leave blank
# to sign locally only (simulator builds don't need a team).
export TUIST_DEV_TEAM_ID=''
